  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "376a88db-db13-4113-9033-cc65d8a900a2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Identify what your player’s core motivation is and how the player progresses."
    },
    {
      "id": "e845dd80-c154-4ea3-9f3f-3a7c89ce1ef0",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "Motivations",
      "anchorId": "motivations"
    },
    {
      "id": "7da13ee1-ec71-42e0-af8f-5013c8dcf708",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "48c3f12f-4105-4ce4-b01a-4467cfd5d2ed",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<strong>Primary motivation</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5e276f6-c56c-4cf1-b480-e0c4574551f0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "What is your player’s primary motivation? What thing drives them in life? (See the talks and pdf in further reading for examples.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "76d7a837-d9f3-4925-afbc-b3e8e15f5a31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "86aad683-f9f0-4c88-86b2-f518b5addf97",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<strong>Secondary motivations</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f4ddb18-ccc7-47bd-9c79-c5cd8ae4844e",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "What other motivations drive your player, if any."
    },
    {
      "id": "815ab8c7-562d-4735-b3ef-82efab03f81d",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "Progression",
      "anchorId": "progression"
    },
    {
      "id": "3ef5edeb-4965-467e-b06c-df8960bb187d",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "How does the core action in the game support your player’s primary motivation?"
    },
    {
      "id": "56937609-0054-476e-a44d-ddbc419e5991",
      "type": "columns",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "394a2176-eed0-4e5e-9d48-a7be13603f95",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "7dd7ef40-032d-4d49-ada7-deb523f94fac",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "For example:"
            },
            {
              "id": "79a6bfea-095a-4b42-8e19-69b4e6f88235",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>Harvest materials</strong>"
            },
            {
              "id": "5f81da3e-23d1-4b0a-a20f-2506df73eda3",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "The player can harvest materials from around them."
            },
            {
              "id": "c5abdc34-53ce-4a89-a11f-ec8d1197a951",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>Build better tools and equipment</strong>"
            },
            {
              "id": "c5c1564e-a8e4-4a83-be87-893500ffb54c",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "The player can use the harvested materials to build better tools and equipment."
            },
            {
              "id": "cd84e94f-a439-456a-b11e-8a50199faaaa",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>Explore further into the unknown</strong>"
            },
            {
              "id": "aaeb4c28-5c8c-4c85-a80e-32a488993ac5",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "The better tools and equipment allows them to explore more distant places without dying."
            },
            {
              "id": "7ad2ea33-a6b3-47d4-9d65-e2a684ce5c9d",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>Achieve a fulfilling sense of discovery</strong>"
            },
            {
              "id": "be29ae9c-259f-4bc8-85a6-04a9ae988e32",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "Exploring more distant places can fill the player with a sense of discovery and achievement."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b8691552-a931-438a-9bd8-01934fe7ffc8",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "f2f7c61d-872c-49fb-b58d-b03fd772fbae",
